{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Rachel envied her sister.</b> She was jealous of her good deeds — she said: had she not been more righteous than I, she would not have merited children (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>Give me.</b> Did your father do so to your mother? And did he not pray for her?" "<b>I am dead.</b> From here: one who has no children is counted as dead (Bereshit Rabbah)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:09.931775266Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}